### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
# Selecciona admin, despacho o custom en el entorno de REST Client.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### 1. Crear una nueva carrera para pruebas de Calificacion
# @name CreateTripRating
POST http://localhost:4000/api/carreras
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passenger_id": 2,
  "shift_id": 2,
  "fare_id": 1
}

###
@newTripRatingId = {{CreateTripRating.response.body.$.trip.id}}

### 2. POST 409 intentar calificar la carrera NO CERRADA
POST http://localhost:4000/api/calificaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trip_id": {{newTripRatingId}},
  "score": 5
}

### 3. Avanzar carrera a cerrada
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripRatingId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "aceptada" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripRatingId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "en_curso" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripRatingId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cerrada" }

### 4. POST 400 score invalido (6)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/calificaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trip_id": {{newTripRatingId}},
  "score": 6
}

### 5. POST válido
POST http://localhost:4000/api/calificaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trip_id": {{newTripRatingId}},
  "score": 4,
  "comment": "Excelente"
}

### 6. POST 409 intentar calificar la misma carrera DE NUEVO
POST http://localhost:4000/api/calificaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trip_id": {{newTripRatingId}},
  "score": 3
}
